    "updated_at": "2023-09-28T04:03:30Z",
    "body": "> A microtask can only be queued in the context of running a task which necessarily has a surrounding agent.\r\n\r\nWhy is this true? E.g. I'm not sure https://drafts.csswg.org/web-animations-1/#update-an-animations-finished-state is being called from a task.\r\n\r\nIf it's a precondition we want to enforce, then let's add an assert?",
