    "body": "Similarly, you could imagine an API like `worker.queueMicrotask(\"code to run\")` which queues a microtask in the corresponding `WorkerGlobalScope` to eval `\"code to run\"`. I guess you're saying we'd force the specification for such an API to first queue a task into the worker, and then from that task queue a microtask? Why?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
