    "updated_at": "2023-09-28T09:01:14Z",
    "body": "Olli gave a good example why it is bad: the microtask might never run. It can only run in the context of a task and there's no guarantee there's a task.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure when there would not be a surrounding agent, but I found something to assert: that event loop has a currently running task.",
