    "created_at": "2023-09-28T10:28:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-28T10:28:20Z",
    "body": "> I'm not sure when there would not be a surrounding agent\r\n\r\nWhen in parallel\r\n\r\n> that event loop has a currently running task.\r\n\r\nThat will crash if you're in parallel (because there's no surrounding agent)\r\n\r\nThis will also fail if you're currently inside a microtask, or inside \"update the rendering\" (e.g. in requestAnimationFrame).",
